 "remarks": "23 Laurel Road is a fully renovated modern residence set on 1.35 acres in North Stamford. Completed in 2026, the extensive gut renovation updated the home throughout and created approximately 7,321 square feet of finished living space across multiple levels. The property offers four bedrooms, four-and-a-half bathrooms, a three-car garage, and a functional layout designed for both everyday living and entertaining.  The main level features oak flooring, spacious living areas, and two fireplaces located in the living room and family room. The kitchen is equipped with Wolf appliances, white shaker cabinetry, dual dishwashers, dual wine coolers, an instant hot water tap, and a walk-in pantry. The layout provides substantial preparation and storage space while maintaining a clean, modern design and a casually elegant overall feel.  Each of the four bedrooms includes a private ensuite bathroom. The primary suite features a fireplace, dual walk-in closets, a dedicated makeup area, dual vanities, a dual-head shower, and a separate water closet.  Additional finished space is available on both the lower level and third floor. The finished attic includes dedicated office space, while the finished basement provides flexible space for recreation, fitness, storage, or additional living use. Laundry areas are located on both the second floor and lower level for added convenience.",
